      "ccl-datavector-to-sacc": "Build an LSST 3x2pt theory data vector with CCL - SRD n(z) bins -> angular C_ell (Limber and FKEM non-Limber) -> sacc file with src{i}/lens{i} tracers -> sacc_inspect -> ready for a firecrown likelihood; the CCLX generate_dv_nonlimber recipe as tools",
